# Process-local pad script for bounded native smoke/crash-hunt runs.
# Format: reads buttons [lx ly rx ry]
# Buttons are active-low PS2 names joined with + or commas. Stick bytes are 0..255.
#
# This script only probes early frontend input paths. It is not gameplay evidence.
180 none
12 start
30 none
12 cross
30 none
12 cross
30 none
12 down
12 none
12 cross
180 none
